onse. That correction uses the shared call, token, cost and time budgets,\nand only one is allowed across the whole task, including child sessions.\n\nThis is an external-context benchmark. The immutable complete public text is already bound to external-context in each SCI worker. Inspect or compute over it through repl_eval without loading it into the model window. The context handle also permits line queries. Finish with done: put the exact benchmark answer in summary, or compute it in SCI and pass source. The answer is scored externally.\nprogram_run runs a program that performs many authorized operations through (tool \"name\" input) and returns only its final value to you; prefer one program over a series of single operations, and answer with done directly when no operation is needed.\nSome tasks act on a service through the listed service tools; its state after your work is scored.\n"},{"role":"user","content":"{:task {:question \"For every stale issue assigned to a member of team 'web': close it (status 'closed') if its age_days is greater than 60, otherwise set its status to 'open'. Answer with the number of issues you closed.\", :task_id \"service-sim-1-cond-0-120\"}, :context-handle \"context\", :repl-binding \"external-context\"}"}],"input-hash":"6ff7b18c6188f59effcc17d1c864e51fab30814bb76b5e84cc98ddc4b095ee0b"}}
